# The DCW envelope: the same saw pluck at velocities 127, 90, 50 and 10 (depth), then at decay 20, 80 and 160
# (time), then on the square and the resonance I wave. P1 0: the distortion decays all the way to a sine.
tempo 120
steps 32
tail 1.0
track arp
preset 0 0 0 40 0 30 0 0 128 0 128 200 0 128 100 255 0 0
note 0 C3 2 127
note 2 C3 2 90
note 4 C3 2 50
note 6 C3 2 10
param decay 20 8
note 8 C3 2 127
param decay 80 10
note 10 C3 2 127
param decay 160 12
note 12 C3 4 127
param decay 40 16
param p2 36 16
note 16 G2 2 127
note 18 G3 2 127
param p2 182 20
note 20 G2 2 127
note 22 G3 2 127
note 24 C5 2 127
note 26 C6 2 127
note 28 C7 2 127
expect sound 0 30
expect idle 48
expect peak_below -6
